    {
      "tier": 1,
      "title": "pg_background v1.9 增加标签与结构化错误信息",
      "summary": "pg_background 把 SQL 交给后台工作进程执行，调用会话不必阻塞，还能做自治事务。Vibhor Kumar 发布的 v1.9 加了四件运维向功能：给工作进程贴最长 64 字节的标签便于辨认；error_info_v2 返回 sqlstate、消息、明细与上下文；result_info_v2 不消费结果就能读到行数和完成状态；另有批量 detach 与 cancel。作者提醒它不是作业调度器的替代品。",
      "url": "https://vibhorkumar.wordpress.com/2026/04/01/pg_background-v1-9-a-calmer-more-practical-way-to-run-sql-in-the-background/",
      "author": "Vibhor Kumar",
      "source": "Vibhor Kumar 博客",
      "source_date": "2026-04-01",
      "image": "https://vibhorkumar.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/image.png",
      "domain": "pg",
      "tags": [
        "扩展",
        "后台任务"
      ],
      "position": 3
    },
    {
      "tier": 1,
      "title": "pgEdge 用 MCP 自定义工具复刻 CrystalDBA 能力",
      "summary": "pgEdge Postgres MCP Server 把 PostgreSQL 接给 Claude Code 这类客户端，自定义工具只能在库内跑 SQL、PL/pgSQL 函数或匿名块，不能发 HTTP 或访问文件系统。Antony Pegg 用一份 1668 行的 YAML 写了三个工具：按耗时或调用次数排慢查询、七项健康检查、以及索引建议。索引建议在没有 HypoPG 时退化成启发式，装了 HypoPG 就用假想索引验证代价。",
      "url": "https://www.pgedge.com/blog/replicating-crystaldba-with-pgedge-mcp-server-custom-tools",
      "author": "Antony Pegg",
      "source": "pgEdge 博客",
      "source_date": "2026-04-01",
      "image": "",
      "domain": "pg",
      "tags": [
        "MCP",
        "诊断",
        "索引"
      ],
      "position": 4
